"core:name": "ACME Banking API",
"core:description": "**ACME Banking API** enables developers to build applications that make use of the information from resource methods implemented in the API. \n\nThis API contains functionality that allows developers to retrieve and manipulate _customer_, _account_ and _transaction_ information.\n\n**ACME Bank** is a _multinational_ banking and financial services organization.\n",
